Nivel de vechime: Nivel mediu de experiență
Tip de angajare: Full-time
Sectoare de activitate: Servicii IT și consultanță IT
At Advisority, we help our clients make their work flow - and achieve more with AI. 
 We combine business understanding with IT capabilities to help our clients focus on what matters most. From our headquarters in London to our teams across Romania, we deliver projects and services across industries including banking, insurance, payments, utilities and pharma. 
 We are looking for a DevOps Engineer to join us and support infrastructure automation and reliable application deployment, with a focus on Kubernetes and Azure.
 Your role within Advisority 
Administer and automate Linux, Windows and Azure infrastructure;
Maintain Jenkins CI/CD pipelines, Git workflows and deployment configurations;
Configure monitoring, logging and alerting with Prometheus/Grafana;
Troubleshoot incidents and perform root cause analysis;
Ensure security, backup, disaster recovery and availability;
Support infrastructure migrations and maintain technical documentation;
Collaborate with technical teams to support reliable infrastructure and deployments.
 What sets you apart 
Strong experience with Kubernetes, its APIs and related tools, Docker and Linux;
Good knowledge of Git and networking: TCP/IP, DNS and HTTP/HTTPS;
Experience with CI/CD pipelines for deployment, testing and validation, using Jenkins or Azure DevOps;
Good knowledge of Ansible Playbooks and Bash or PowerShell for automation;
Terraform, Prometheus/Grafana, ELK/OpenSearch, Python, cloud security and GitOps experience are a plus.
 How we work 
 We believe in Trust, Fairness, Agility, Inclusivity and Resilience — values that shape how we work with our people, our clients and each other.
